{"id":"autorite_","lemma":"autorité","pos":"noun","rank":2111,"glosses":["authority (the power to enforce rules or give orders)","authority (entity with power)"],"ipa":"/o.tɔ.ʁi.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4c/Fr-autorit%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-autorit%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"autorités"},"formAudio":{"autorités":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/03/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-autorit%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Il a outrepassé son autorité.","en":"He has overstepped his authority.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to go beyond","l":"outrepasser"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Je vais vous dénoncer aux autorités.","en":"I'm going to report you to the authorities.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to denounce"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Tu abuses de ton autorité.","en":"You are abusing your authority.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to mislead","l":"abuser"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Vous abusez de votre autorité.","en":"You are abusing your authority.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to mislead","l":"abuser"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"Il est une autorité reconnue sur le sujet.","en":"He is a recognized authority on the subject.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"subject, topic"}]}]}